{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Recheck scope fatals after invocation-end hooks.** After a handoff timeout, the handler owner can report a `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath` while this awaited hook is blocked. Since the only check occurs before dispatch, `execute()` still returns PENDING/RETRYING even though the fatal was observed before finalization returned. Check `scopeFatal` again after `onInvocationEnd`, and change the delayed-finalizer test to require the original fatal to reach the invocation caller.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc76gZba","finding_digest":"d43371534e39ba8ef3db8885e66b122c9182a4cc77f87519192245519be87d31","finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","line":356,"observation_digest":"69d4a6cc2ffd8b1682b77fced8571dc5bb16b8d4645839d5b03db44b6e7a271c","observation_id":"aro_v1_nhkkntbp7wfrnavxp7hnqvy5yw","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","published_at":"2026-10-07T03:34:52Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ybe2sdf45kr4cbuej4ll5fb6mf","reviewed_base_sha":"34c174f2819f715cf26e88aa8dbabd7d40cb9ad8","reviewed_head_sha":"e1526296d49e4861e1285862e6b92514c4e1eb2c","reviewer":"codex","start_line":356,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_qzi3xthvnc2zbnc77ia76gzlbf","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T03:34:52Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
